{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>周杰倫不僅吸金功力驚人！喜愛藝術的他常會砸巨資購買名畫，520這天他吐露自己夢想成真，買到了野獸派創始人法國畫家亨利馬諦斯的畫作，拍賣價格高</p><p>周杰倫IG發文透露：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260521/1134148022851080192138205.jpeg/lCam2fKfAp_yohABw2nd5OMTLl9234ro1TB0ztUwdM4\" alt=\"周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><p>更多周杰倫的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260521/1134145824830263296301548.jpeg/paZ01Mv1Fu9yXQT8TbrBG3xmmfYNGNtHrwNJk68DSZM\" alt=\"周杰倫也曾分享過其他畫作。（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫也曾分享過其他畫作。（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073300033736544256769324.jpeg/Ar-JAeBxaqfK5JFD5vLViTfmDsGdpBiTbNfS5GzX0uQ\" alt=\"周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073300028749385728432870.jpeg/FoSCDRbMr7XXpkiuPAP9KyCSswmrr1V6Xv5DjF7-Q4w\" alt=\"周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073300031685398528923506.jpeg/B6yKOqyygC4lgFRhQnWu1VMWX4pgu-XO5ViIp-VYiKc\" alt=\"周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073300031584866304541896.jpeg/fCDtQzYfkhZK0J8OJEQOKMlYlyPqmipmhUajrYVGo60\" alt=\"周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073300030490152960428395.jpeg/tZj2V3TROnXPfqFVQtwM7WI0d_tvtyzbK0uGrStLhq0\" alt=\"周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073300026152980480081267.jpeg/T_I50BBwP5rZolM1g32ynEcmh4bgLuISwtL_HcLS_x0\" alt=\"周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）\"><figcaption>周杰倫（Instagram@jaychou）